      <h1>Emergency Plumber in Southport</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">24/7 emergency plumber covering Lord Street, Birkdale, Hesketh Park, Ainsdale and the wider PR8 and PR9. We're in Kirkby, same Sefton Council as you. 40 minute drive via the A570. £80 an hour fixed. No distance premium.</p>

      <div style="background:var(--navy);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1rem 1.5rem;max-width:320px;margin:1.25rem auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;">
