  <!-- HONEST FRAMING SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#fef3c7;border-top:3px solid var(--orange);border-bottom:3px solid var(--orange);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Honest About Southport.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0;">We're at <strong>29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL</strong>. Southport is 17 miles north. The drive takes 35 to 45 minutes via the A570 or A59. Southport has no direct motorway link, so nothing's faster.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-top:0.75rem;">If you need a 15 minute response, a local Southport plumber will be faster. We're useful when the local plumbers are tied up, for out of hours cover, and for landlords with rentals across Sefton (Southport, Formby, Crosby, Maghull). Same fixed rates across all of it. No distance premium.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- PROPERTY TYPES -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pf-section-label">SOUTHPORT HOMES WE COVER</span>
      <h2>One Plumber. Every Type of PR8 Property.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Southport is a Victorian seaside town with 94,000 residents. The property mix runs from Lord Street flats to golf-belt detached houses. Here's what we usually find.</p>
      <div class="pf-why-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Lord Street Conversions</h3>
          <p>The famous Victorian canopied boulevard. Buildings from the 1860s onwards, originally houses, now mostly flats and shops. Mixed-era plumbing in every one. The Lord Street Living scheme is now converting upper floors back to flats.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Hesketh Park Victorian Villas</h3>
          <p>Large detached and semi-detached Victorian villas from the 1880s. Built for wealthy holidaymakers and Liverpool merchants. Multiple bathrooms, original Victorian features, complex plumbing. We carry parts for both period and modern fittings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Birkdale and Hillside Golf Belt</h3>
          <p>The PR8 4 affluent residential streets near Royal Birkdale and Hillside Golf Clubs. Large detached family homes, often with separate utility rooms and en-suite bathrooms. Modern combi boilers, push-fit plumbing. G3 qualified for unvented work.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Ainsdale Bungalows and Semis</h3>
          <p>Modern semi-detached and bungalow stock popular with retirees. 1960s to 1990s construction. System boilers, hot water cylinders, three-port valves. We carry common spares.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Town Centre Flats and HMOs</h3>
          <p>The PR8 1 town centre is mostly flats and Victorian conversions. 57% single-person households in the Lord Street postcodes. Strong landlord and HMO market. We cover landlord call-outs at fixed rates.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Churchtown and Marshside Older Stock</h3>
          <p>The original village of Churchtown, where William Sutton ran the Black Bull Inn before he founded Southport in 1792, has older period properties. PR9 borders. We cover these at the same rates.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Emergency Plumber Southport. Fixed Rates. Same as Liverpool.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Written quote before work starts. 1 hour minimum on every call-out. Parts at cost. No distance premium for Southport. Same rate whether you're on Lord Street or Lord Street Liverpool city centre.</p>

      <div class="pf-pricing-grid">
        <div class="pf-price-card">
          <div class="pf-price-tier">WEEKDAY</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Monday to Friday</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">9am to 5pm</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£80<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>40 min drive from Kirkby</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
            <li>Parts at cost</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-navy btn-full">Call Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-price-card">
          <div class="pf-price-tier">WEEKEND</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Saturday to Sunday</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">9am to 1pm</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£120<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>Same fixed rate</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
            <li>Parts at cost</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-navy btn-full">Call Now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-price-card pf-price-card-featured">
          <div class="pf-price-badge">24/7</div>
          <div class="pf-price-tier">OUT OF HOURS</div>
          <div class="pf-price-name">Nights and Holidays</div>
          <div class="pf-price-sub">Always available</div>
          <div class="pf-price-amount">£150<small>/hr</small></div>
          <ul class="pf-price-list">
            <li>Real person answers now</li>
            <li>Priority response</li>
            <li>Gas Safe engineer</li>
            <li>1 hour minimum</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-orange btn-full" style="color:#ffffff;">Call Now. We Answer.</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-alert" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <strong>No Southport premium</strong>
        <p>Some emergency plumbers charge more for "remote area" cover. We don't. The <a href="https://www.checkatrade.com/blog/cost-guides/plumber-call-out-fee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Checkatrade typical price for emergency plumber call-outs</a> in the wider Liverpool area runs £80 to £180 an hour. We sit at the bottom end whether you're in Kirkby or Southport.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- LOCAL KNOWLEDGE SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pf-section-label">SOUTHPORT LOCAL KNOWLEDGE</span>
      <h2>What PR8 Plumbing Really Looks Like</h2>

      <div class="pf-card pf-card-left-orange" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <p>Southport is in Sefton Metropolitan Borough Council. Same council as our Kirkby base, Maghull, Crosby and Formby. Population around 94,000. The third most populous settlement in the Liverpool City Region.</p>

        <p>The town was founded in 1792. William Sutton, an innkeeper from Churchtown, built a bathing house at what's now the south end of Lord Street. The area was sand dunes. Locals called the place "Duke's Folly". The name stuck and the town grew. The railway came in 1848. Most of what you see today went up between the 1850s and the 1910s.</p>

        <p>That Victorian heritage is the plumbing reality. Lord Street buildings are 130 to 170 years old. Hesketh Park villas the same. Every one has been through multiple plumbing upgrades. Lead, copper, cast iron, plastic. We diagnose what's there before quoting.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pf-card pf-card-left-orange" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <p>Southport has no direct motorway link. It's the second-largest town in Britain without one, after Eastbourne. The A570 and A59 are the only routes in. That's why our drive time is 40 minutes from Kirkby, not 15.</p>

        <p>That said, we cover Southport every week. Landlords with rentals across Sefton use one phone number for Southport, Formby, Crosby and Maghull. We also pick up jobs when the local plumbers (Southport Plumbers, Greg's Plumbing, R Whitfield and others) are at full capacity.</p>

        <p>The Marine Lake Events Centre opens in 2027, with 515,000 visitors a year projected. The Lord Street Living scheme is converting upper shop floors back to flats. Sefton Council is investing heavily. The Southport rental market is one to watch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- COMMON JOBS -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Common Emergency Jobs in Southport</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">What we attend most often in PR8.</p>
      <div class="jobs-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Victorian Lead Pipe Failures</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">40 min response</span></div>
          <p>Lord Street and Hesketh Park properties have original lead supply pipes from the 1880s. After 140 years they fail without warning. We replace with copper or MDPE plastic. Most same-visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Coastal Air Corrosion</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">40 min response</span></div>
          <p>Sea air rusts metal faster than inland. External boiler flues, outside taps and exposed copper pipework corrode quicker in Southport. A corroded flue is a carbon monoxide risk. We check every flue on every visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>HMO and Conversion Emergencies</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">40 min response</span></div>
          <p>57% of Lord Street residents live alone. Lots of HMOs and Victorian conversions. Communal hot water and boiler systems. A fault affects every flat. We coordinate with managing agents and provide written reports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Elderly Resident Priority</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">40 min response</span></div>
          <p>Southport has a strong retirement demographic. No heat or hot water for an elderly resident living alone is a welfare emergency. Flag this on the call. We prioritise and carry portable electric heaters in case parts aren't on the van.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Landlord Portfolio Call-Outs</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">Same-day available</span></div>
          <p>One phone number for properties across Southport, Formby, Crosby and Maghull. Batch CP12 paperwork. Written reports for insurance. Same fixed rates whichever Sefton town the rental is in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Boiler Replacement on Older Stock</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">40 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many Southport homes have system boilers feeding hot water cylinders, often 20+ years old. New combi from £1,800 fitted. 10-year warranty. ECO4 grant check on every quote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHAT TO DO SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>While You Wait For Our Engineer</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Four steps to protect your home while we're on the way. We're 40 minutes from Kirkby, so these matter.</p>
      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">1</span><div><strong>Find the stopcock and turn it off</strong><p>For any water leak, the stopcock is your first move. In most Southport homes it's under the kitchen sink, in the cellar, or near the front door. In Lord Street flats it can be in the airing cupboard. Turn it clockwise to stop all water.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">2</span><div><strong>If you smell gas, get out</strong><p>Don't touch any switches. Open windows as you leave. Call <a href="https://cadentgas.com/emergencies" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;">Cadent Gas on 0800 111 999</a> first. Then us on 0151 558 0334 once the home is safe.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">3</span><div><strong>No heating? Check the pressure gauge</strong><p>Look at the gauge on the boiler. It should sit between 1 and 1.5 bar. Below 0.5, top it up with the filling loop underneath. That fixes about half of all "no heating" calls. We've saved you a 40 minute drive each way.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">4</span><div><strong>Photograph the damage</strong><p>Take photos and video before you start cleaning. Insurance claims need proof. We give you our own fault report with photos as well.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- SERVICES SECTION -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Other Plumbing and Heating Services in Southport</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Not an emergency? We cover all plumbing and heating work across PR8. Gas Safe registered. Fixed prices. Free surveys.</p>
      <div class="pf-related" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <a href="/gas-safety-certificate-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>CP12 for Southport Landlords</strong><span>CP12 paperwork from £80 per property. Batch pricing across Sefton portfolios. Combined service and CP12 from £175.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/boiler-installation-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Installation Southport</strong><span>New boiler from £1,800 fully fitted. Worcester Bosch, Vaillant, Ideal. 10-year warranty. ECO4 grant check on every quote. Free survey across PR8.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/boiler-service-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Service Southport</strong><span>Annual boiler service from £120. Gas Safe engineer. Certificate same day. Keeps your warranty valid.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/power-flushing-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Power Flushing Southport</strong><span>Cold radiators or noisy boiler? Power flush from £350 for systems up to 10 radiators. Common upgrade in Victorian stock.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/radiators-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Radiator Repairs and Swaps</strong><span>New radiators from £200 supply and fit. Period-style replacements for Hesketh Park Victorian villas.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/showers-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Shower Installation and Repairs</strong><span>Electric showers from £200 supply and fit. Shower mixer from £300. Cartridge swaps from £100.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHY CHOOSE -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why Southport Customers Choose Us</h2>
      <div class="pf-why-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Same Sefton Council</h3><p>Our base in Kirkby and your home in Southport are both in Sefton-bordering or Sefton areas. We know the council, the planning rules, the rental market.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>No Distance Premium</h3><p>Same £80 weekday rate as our Liverpool coverage. We don't charge more because you're further away. Most plumbers cover their distance in higher rates. We don't.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Sefton Portfolio Cover</h3><p>One phone number for rentals across Southport, Formby, Crosby and Maghull. Batch CP12 paperwork. Single contact for landlord call-outs.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Our Own Gas Safe Engineers</h3><p>Every engineer is our own staff. No sub-contractors. No agency. Check our entry at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>.</p></div>
